-        portal's ``OpenPipeWireRemote``, where the fd stands on its own. An application that calls this and then drops its session
-        bus connection (a short script letting it go out of scope, say) will
-        see @fd close a moment later, and should hold that connection for as
-        long as it uses this one.
+        portal's ``OpenPipeWireRemote``, where the fd stands on its own. An
+        application that calls this and then drops its session bus connection
+        (a short script letting it go out of scope, say) will see @fd close a
